      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historic downtown Logan has been revitalized with restored buildings, bustling sidewalks, and colorful flowerbeds that bring new life to every corner.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.explorehockinghills.com/visit-historic-downtown-logan/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Hocking County Historical and Genealogical Society & Museum, housed in a historic building, showcases artifacts and local lore from pioneer days to today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.explorehockinghills.com/visit-historic-downtown-logan/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Bowen House, a 19th‑century home turned arts center, hosts rotating art exhibits, music performances, workshops, and community events.",
